    "Allowed in System Settings: it works once AutoHush reopens." : {
      "comment" : "Add an App window, under Audio Recording before the check, after the user allowed it in System Settings: macOS applies it only from AutoHush's next launch; a Reopen AutoHush button follows",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مسموح به في إعدادات النظام: يعمل بمجرد إعادة فتح AutoHush."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permès a Configuració del Sistema: funciona quan l’AutoHush es torni a obrir."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Povoleno v Nastavení systému: začne fungovat po opětovném otevření AutoHush."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tilladt i Systemindstillinger: det virker, når AutoHush åbnes igen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
